## SQ-FCK-01 | weeds blacklisted, Rich Farmland fertile; clicks on weeds change nothing; weeds place on three soils
@group A
@commands Tag probe `#quark:simple_harvest_blacklisted`, `#immersive_weathering:fertile_blocks`; fake player right-clicks `immersive_weathering:weeds[age=7]` on farmland (empty hand, then iron hoe); places the weeds item on `farmersdelight:rich_soil_farmland`, `farmersdelight:rich_soil`, `immersive_weathering:mulch_block`
@pass weeds in the blacklist, Rich Farmland in fertile_blocks; the right-clicks change nothing; the weed places on all three soils (CR-108, CR-109 placement half)
@fails `crop_tags.js` not in the CD jar; `global.has(item.weeds)` false
@from batches/r1113/c3_a1.qb
> zq itemtag quark:simple_harvest_blacklisted
> zq blocktag quark:simple_harvest_blacklisted
> zq blocktag immersive_weathering:fertile_blocks
waitlog \[zq\] blocktag immersive_weathering:fertile_blocks 30
expect simple_harvest_blacklisted \(\d+\):.*immersive_weathering:weeds
expect blocktag immersive_weathering:fertile_blocks \(\d+\):.*farmersdelight:rich_soil_farmland
> setblock 1000 -61 1070 minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> setblock 1000 -60 1070 immersive_weathering:weeds[age=7]
> clear G
> pbot use G 1000 -60 1070 up
> pbot hold G minecraft:iron_hoe 1
> pbot use G 1000 -60 1070 up
> zc3 bstate 1000 -60 1070
expect bstate 1000 -60 1070 Block\{immersive_weathering:weeds\}\[age=7\]
> setblock 1002 -61 1070 farmersdelight:rich_soil_farmland
> setblock 1004 -61 1070 farmersdelight:rich_soil
> setblock 1006 -61 1070 immersive_weathering:mulch_block
> pbot hold G immersive_weathering:weeds 3
> pbot use G 1002 -61 1070 up
> pbot use G 1004 -61 1070 up
> pbot use G 1006 -61 1070 up
> zc3 bstate 1002 -60 1070 1004 -60 1070 1006 -60 1070
expect bstate 1002 -60 1070 Block\{immersive_weathering:weeds\}
expect bstate 1004 -60 1070 Block\{immersive_weathering:weeds\}
expect bstate 1006 -60 1070 Block\{immersive_weathering:weeds\}
look the blacklist tag the row means may be the item or the block tag (both printed); weeds still age 7 after both clicks

