## SQ-FCK-07 | glow lichen in a 9x9-chunk plains box about 3x the control boot (c3_b2.qb, SQ-FCK-07c); no lichen codec error
@group A
@commands Fresh world, pregen a 9x9 chunk area around 0,0 in a plains / forest seed; count `minecraft:glow_lichen` blocks (`tools/farm_worldgen_probe.js` block census or WorldEdit `//count`); same on a control boot with the two `kubejs/data/minecraft/worldgen/*/glow_lichen.json` files moved out
