@fails JSON codec error (1.19.2 IntProvider shape); a mod's biome lists a different lichen feature
@from batches/r1113/c3_b1.qb
bootreject glow_lichen.*([Cc]odec|[Ee]rror|Failed)|Failed to parse.*glow_lichen
> locate biome minecraft:plains
waitlog nearest minecraft:plains is at|Could not find 300
capture PL minecraft:plains is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
