waitlog \[zq\] count minecraft:glow_lichen: \d+ 900
> forceload remove {PL1-72} {PL3-72} {PL1+71} {PL3+71}
look count here vs SQ-FCK-07c (same seed and box): about 3x or more. The plains spot is the same in both boots (same seed); note both counts

